<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 150 mln rand five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 150 mln rand five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15	  MATURITY    11.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    11.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
